@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = PASTE_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@transactionId = PASTE_TRANSACTION_ID_HERE
@userId = PASTE_USER_ID_HERE

### Overview: money stats, liabilities, payout queue and 7 days of cash flow
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/finance/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Transactions: every ledger row, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/finance/transactions?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Transactions: settled platform fees this month
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/finance/transactions?account=platform&type=platformFee&status=success&from=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-10-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Transactions: search by owner name, phone, email or reference
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/finance/transactions?search=Ama&direction=credit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Transactions: one row
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/finance/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Transactions: unknown id (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/finance/transactions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Transactions: from after to (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/finance/transactions?from=2026-10-02T00:00:00Z&to=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Wallets: drivers, largest balance first
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/finance/wallets?role=driver
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Wallets: frozen ones
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/finance/wallets?status=frozen
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Wallets: one user's ledger
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/finance/wallets/{{userId}}/transactions?type=topup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Wallets: unknown user (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/finance/wallets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Payouts: the approval queue, oldest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/finance/payouts?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Payouts: no token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/finance/payouts
